(5467973, 787655, 88136, '<td valign="top">fun editing, nice detailed shot. i love all the textures and various colors</td>', 'fun editing, nice detailed shot. i love all the textures and various colors', '2009-05-04 14:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468024, 787729, 101256, '<td valign="top">An uncomfortable type of image of a result that could happen to anyone at anytime. The unkown is always different and in some ways, this is a sad and somewhat depresssing image. Not your everyday image for a challenge like this, it does make sense. One can only hope that identification is made and proper respect made. An excellant conversion to black and white. It might have been a better choice to keep everything in focus, but this does work as it is.</td>', 'An uncomfortable type of image of a result that could happen to anyone at anytime. The unkown is always different and in some ways, this is a sad and somewhat depresssing image. Not your everyday image for a challenge like this, it does make sense. One can only hope that identification is made and proper respect made. An excellant conversion to black and white. It might have been a better choice to keep everything in focus, but this does work as it is.', '2009-05-04 15:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468029, 787638, 101256, '<td valign="top">Rich and detailed, in addition to being one of this reviewer''s favorite movies, a very good look at home movie night. Nothing seems out of place and it''s a very comfortable image to look at being a very common place event. A technical success, it also invokes a certain level of visual interest from an artistic standpoint - this could serve well as a stock shot for a home movie advertisement.</td>', 'Rich and detailed, in addition to being one of this reviewer''s favorite movies, a very good look at home movie night. Nothing seems out of place and it''s a very comfortable image to look at being a very common place event. A technical success, it also invokes a certain level of visual interest from an artistic standpoint - this could serve well as a stock shot for a home movie advertisement.', '2009-05-04 15:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468044, 787613, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fabulous shot - a real stand out for me.</td>', 'Fabulous shot - a real stand out for me.', '2009-05-04 15:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468056, 787577, 101256, '<td valign="top">This rather dark image invokes a sense of noir mystery - a set piece scene where the murderer is either about to be revealed or another attempt is going to be made. A very good conversion, it has all the elements of proper zone system use for effect. The china is particularly interesting and detailed. A technical success with good artistic impact.</td>', 'This rather dark image invokes a sense of noir mystery - a set piece scene where the murderer is either about to be revealed or another attempt is going to be made. A very good conversion, it has all the elements of proper zone system use for effect. The china is particularly interesting and detailed. A technical success with good artistic impact.', '2009-05-04 15:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468081, 787910, 101256, '<td valign="top">A different look at the challenge subject, this still life is very reminiscent of the late 19th, early 20th century Russian genre of art called Constructionism. The primary element of this school of thought was the concept of Faktura - referring to the material aspect of the surface each part exhibiting its own distinctiveness and unique nature. Clearly, this image reflects that concept and shows it in it''s most positive light. The rich textures and colors of the satin are complimentary of the foreground objects in every way. A success from a technical standpoint with one minor issue not worth mentioning as it takes a while to see it. Artistically, the author showed evidence of having patience in setting the image up and properly using light and shadow to it''s best effect. While it may not suit the general taste, this should properly be placed as a ribbon winner for it''s concept and execution in addition to it''s overall artistic impact. Well done.</td>', 'A different look at the challenge subject, this still life is very reminiscent of the late 19th, early 20th century Russian genre of art called Constructionism. The primary element of this school of thought was the concept of Faktura - referring to the material aspect of the surface each part exhibiting its own distinctiveness and unique nature. Clearly, this image reflects that concept and shows it in it''s most positive light. The rich textures and colors of the satin are complimentary of the foreground objects in every way. A success from a technical standpoint with one minor issue not worth mentioning as it takes a while to see it. Artistically, the author showed evidence of having patience in setting the image up and properly using light and shadow to it''s best effect. While it may not suit the general taste, this should properly be placed as a ribbon winner for it''s concept and execution in addition to it''s overall artistic impact. Well done.', '2009-05-04 16:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468092, 787567, 327, '<td valign="top">Good entry with good humor. Hope this does well.</td>', 'Good entry with good humor. Hope this does well.', '2009-05-04 16:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
