(5468253, 787554, 26001, '<td valign="top">simplicity at its best. i liked your idea of using the bottom lighting to create beautiful reflection.</td>', 'simplicity at its best. i liked your idea of using the bottom lighting to create beautiful reflection.', '2009-05-04 17:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
