(5468279, 787155, 33352, '<td valign="top">Does not quite give the perspective required for the challenge, the camera would have been better on thier table...</td>', 'Does not quite give the perspective required for the challenge, the camera would have been better on thier table...', '2009-05-04 18:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468285, 786072, 33352, '<td valign="top">The left chair is slightly distracting, very good use of the lighting....</td>', 'The left chair is slightly distracting, very good use of the lighting....', '2009-05-04 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468286, 787880, 33352, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and composed....</td>', 'Well thought out and composed....', '2009-05-04 18:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468289, 787883, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another interesting image - cats are always fun to photograph as they exhibit a lot of curiosity when confronted with something new or different. An image in which one might view negatively because of the DOF on the cat, but it can also be viewed as a positive as it does give the image some depth. This may have been a much better color image given the nature of the cat - the reflection shows off some different tonal quality on the cat''s face that may have worked better in color. A different look might have been to take a more open aperature look to enhance the cat''s quality of concentration. Still a good effort that falls just shy of being really effective in a technical and artistic sense.</td>', 'Another interesting image - cats are always fun to photograph as they exhibit a lot of curiosity when confronted with something new or different. An image in which one might view negatively because of the DOF on the cat, but it can also be viewed as a positive as it does give the image some depth. This may have been a much better color image given the nature of the cat - the reflection shows off some different tonal quality on the cat''s face that may have worked better in color. A different look might have been to take a more open aperature look to enhance the cat''s quality of concentration. Still a good effort that falls just shy of being really effective in a technical and artistic sense.', '2009-05-04 18:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468290, 787861, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept, B/W would have been a killer here.....</td>', 'Very nice concept, B/W would have been a killer here.....', '2009-05-04 18:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468291, 787819, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good attitude....</td>', 'Good attitude....', '2009-05-04 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
