(5468296, 787817, 33352, '<td valign="top">A little over dodged you can see the lighting rings on the background...like the sharpness...</td>', 'A little over dodged you can see the lighting rings on the background...like the sharpness...', '2009-05-04 18:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468298, 787168, 33352, '<td valign="top">maybe a little more foreground table!! nice capture...</td>', 'maybe a little more foreground table!! nice capture...', '2009-05-04 18:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468300, 787416, 101256, '<td valign="top">The table reflection shot seems to be a theme in this challenge. In this case, it works as an image if there were less reflection from the table surface. In order to be truly technically effective, there has to be a little more definition to the reflection than is exhibited here. The rest of the image is a technical success as it''s crisp, sharp and has something interesting to look at. That being said, it''s artistic impression is positive having pleasing colors and textures in addition to a rather interesting critter to look at. A very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'The table reflection shot seems to be a theme in this challenge. In this case, it works as an image if there were less reflection from the table surface. In order to be truly technically effective, there has to be a little more definition to the reflection than is exhibited here. The rest of the image is a technical success as it''s crisp, sharp and has something interesting to look at. That being said, it''s artistic impression is positive having pleasing colors and textures in addition to a rather interesting critter to look at. A very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-04 18:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468303, 785654, 33352, '<td valign="top">seems to be tlited to the left, maybe just my eye, clever take without the subject moving...</td>', 'seems to be tlited to the left, maybe just my eye, clever take without the subject moving...', '2009-05-04 18:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
