(5468475, 787901, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a sense of humor in this image that may, or may not, have been intentional. The title combined with the expression of the Queen is perfect - the whole construction is well thought out with excellant lighting. A complete technical success that positively impacts the artistic component with the in-depth detail and sense of space and dimension. A very well thought out image that deserves high placement in the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'There is a sense of humor in this image that may, or may not, have been intentional. The title combined with the expression of the Queen is perfect - the whole construction is well thought out with excellant lighting. A complete technical success that positively impacts the artistic component with the in-depth detail and sense of space and dimension. A very well thought out image that deserves high placement in the challenge. Well done.', '2009-05-04 19:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468477, 787384, 33352, '<td valign="top">big table and clever...</td>', 'big table and clever...', '2009-05-04 19:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468478, 787395, 101256, '<td valign="top">Laugh out loud funny - technically perfect - a terrific artistic impression make this a wonderful image to review. Rather than wax poetic about the out of the box originality in evidence, let''s just sit back and enjoy what should be a ribbon winner. Terrific idea perfectly executed. Well done.</td>', 'Laugh out loud funny - technically perfect - a terrific artistic impression make this a wonderful image to review. Rather than wax poetic about the out of the box originality in evidence, let''s just sit back and enjoy what should be a ribbon winner. Terrific idea perfectly executed. Well done.', '2009-05-04 19:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
