(5468524, 787816, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very clean and crisp, but cats eating on the table :-)....</td>', 'Very clean and crisp, but cats eating on the table :-)....', '2009-05-04 20:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468533, 787011, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very different type of table reflection, the perfect surface allowed for exact replication with one fault - the tops of the feet are not exactly replicated on the bottom reflection - there is a difference that while not noticable at first, that becomes more prominent and distracting the longer it''s viewed. While minor, it does affect the image negatively. Technically, given the flaw, the conversion is perfect and shows a indepth knowledge of how to handle the zone system for maximum impact. From an artistic standpoint, it conveys a positive impression on first viewing. Well done.</td>', 'A very different type of table reflection, the perfect surface allowed for exact replication with one fault - the tops of the feet are not exactly replicated on the bottom reflection - there is a difference that while not noticable at first, that becomes more prominent and distracting the longer it''s viewed. While minor, it does affect the image negatively. Technically, given the flaw, the conversion is perfect and shows a indepth knowledge of how to handle the zone system for maximum impact. From an artistic standpoint, it conveys a positive impression on first viewing. Well done.', '2009-05-04 20:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468538, 787866, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more subtle lighting would have been a huge plus in this image as it appears to be over done in some areas and under exposed in others allowing for light blooms that, while not overdone, distract. From an artistic standpoint, it needs something to create a little more interest - perhaps a little closer look at the coffee machine or the impliments baskets would have been a better choice - in partucular against the tiled background. A little more staging of the shot would have resulted in a better image.</td>', 'A little more subtle lighting would have been a huge plus in this image as it appears to be over done in some areas and under exposed in others allowing for light blooms that, while not overdone, distract. From an artistic standpoint, it needs something to create a little more interest - perhaps a little closer look at the coffee machine or the impliments baskets would have been a better choice - in partucular against the tiled background. A little more staging of the shot would have resulted in a better image.', '2009-05-04 20:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468543, 787708, 101256, '<td valign="top">Uneven lighting affects this image negatively and what should have been an interesting look into curiosity of a child is less interesting as a result. Properly framed and captured with a very interesting background, the child''s complexsion appears washed out and unhealthy which is obviously not the case at all. A little more lighting control would have made this an outstanding contribution to the challenge.</td>', 'Uneven lighting affects this image negatively and what should have been an interesting look into curiosity of a child is less interesting as a result. Properly framed and captured with a very interesting background, the child''s complexsion appears washed out and unhealthy which is obviously not the case at all. A little more lighting control would have made this an outstanding contribution to the challenge.', '2009-05-04 20:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468545, 787167, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another laugh out loud funny image, this is very creative and unique - something not seen before by this reviewer. A complete technical and artistic success - an idea that this reviewer might steal sometime in the future. Singularly unique. Well done.</td>', 'Another laugh out loud funny image, this is very creative and unique - something not seen before by this reviewer. A complete technical and artistic success - an idea that this reviewer might steal sometime in the future. Singularly unique. Well done.', '2009-05-04 20:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468553, 787934, 101256, '<td valign="top">The DOF in this image is a problem along with the out of focus pong ball - the while under lit scene with the soft focus just quite doesn''t work from an artistic standpoint. Technically, a little higher ISO and a slower shutter speed to create motion blur on the ball would have helped this image a lot.</td>', 'The DOF in this image is a problem along with the out of focus pong ball - the while under lit scene with the soft focus just quite doesn''t work from an artistic standpoint. Technically, a little higher ISO and a slower shutter speed to create motion blur on the ball would have helped this image a lot.', '2009-05-04 20:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468560, 787663, 55838, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the tones and the real moment. 8</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the tones and the real moment. 8', '2009-05-04 20:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468566, 787941, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes an idea is carried just a bit too far to be truly effective. In this case, the rich colors and detailed models in this diorama should have been perfectly in focus to be perfectly effective. The reason is that car shows like this have a mix of modern and the antique - it perfectly replicates car shows in which owners adopt the clothing and styles of the era their cars are from and non-owner attendees wear suitable street clothing for viewing - it''s a different type of reenactment that is a lot of fun to do for the participants. A longer look would have not hurt the sense of depth and dimension. Still, having said all that, it is a good capture, just a little shy of being artistically perfect. Well done.</td>', 'Sometimes an idea is carried just a bit too far to be truly effective. In this case, the rich colors and detailed models in this diorama should have been perfectly in focus to be perfectly effective. The reason is that car shows like this have a mix of modern and the antique - it perfectly replicates car shows in which owners adopt the clothing and styles of the era their cars are from and non-owner attendees wear suitable street clothing for viewing - it''s a different type of reenactment that is a lot of fun to do for the participants. A longer look would have not hurt the sense of depth and dimension. Still, having said all that, it is a good capture, just a little shy of being artistically perfect. Well done.', '2009-05-04 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468567, 787567, 55838, '<td valign="top">Hilarious and well "shot".  : )  8 from me.</td>', 'Hilarious and well "shot".  : )  8 from me.', '2009-05-04 20:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468579, 787862, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more bokeh and about an 1/8th crop off the top to reduce the overly blank and unappealing sky would have significantly helped this image. The crisp and sharp details, including the parallax distortion of the straw, are a great contribution to the overall effect. A good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A little more bokeh and about an 1/8th crop off the top to reduce the overly blank and unappealing sky would have significantly helped this image. The crisp and sharp details, including the parallax distortion of the straw, are a great contribution to the overall effect. A good entry into the challenge.', '2009-05-04 20:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468580, 787831, 55838, '<td valign="top">Awwww.  I get a lot of these "beautiful" flowers myself.  Hand picked with sweetest love.  Darling moment captured.</td>', 'Awwww.  I get a lot of these "beautiful" flowers myself.  Hand picked with sweetest love.  Darling moment captured.', '2009-05-04 20:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468586, 787745, 55838, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Nice contrast too.  Something tells me that it wasn''t hard to get the kiddos to "pose" for you!  : )</td>', 'Very cute!  Nice contrast too.  Something tells me that it wasn''t hard to get the kiddos to "pose" for you!  : )', '2009-05-04 20:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468594, 786585, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing concept here with the table cloth reflecting odd lighting effects off the window - a major plus to the artistic impact of the image. The rather simple place setting along with the off set wine glass, imparts a rather natural and candid impression. A very interesting reflection on the left that seems to be out of place is also interesting and not readily visible at first. A very competant capture using all the available natural effects at once. Well done.</td>', 'A very intriguing concept here with the table cloth reflecting odd lighting effects off the window - a major plus to the artistic impact of the image. The rather simple place setting along with the off set wine glass, imparts a rather natural and candid impression. A very interesting reflection on the left that seems to be out of place is also interesting and not readily visible at first. A very competant capture using all the available natural effects at once. Well done.', '2009-05-04 20:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468600, 787777, 55838, '<td valign="top">Cool interesting different shot.  Attractive DOF and light &amp; shadow.  8</td>', 'Cool interesting different shot.  Attractive DOF and light & shadow.  8', '2009-05-04 20:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468606, 787167, 55838, '<td valign="top">So cute.  Wonderful idea and a nice clean shot.  My eyes would like it to be a tad lighter.  Made me smile.</td>', 'So cute.  Wonderful idea and a nice clean shot.  My eyes would like it to be a tad lighter.  Made me smile.', '2009-05-04 20:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468607, 787168, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good detail and excellant bokeh make this an effective image. The subject is richly detailed and although the feet are out of focus, it still is a very detailed and effective image. While technically competant, the artistic impact isn''t quite as effective being a fairly common close up view of a recently hatched chick. Still, a good entry into the challenge meeting the challenge criteria.</td>', 'Good detail and excellant bokeh make this an effective image. The subject is richly detailed and although the feet are out of focus, it still is a very detailed and effective image. While technically competant, the artistic impact isn''t quite as effective being a fairly common close up view of a recently hatched chick. Still, a good entry into the challenge meeting the challenge criteria.', '2009-05-04 20:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468643, 787729, 30669, '<td valign="top">OUCH</td>', 'OUCH', '2009-05-04 21:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468680, 787790, 327, '<td valign="top">The quality of your image is very good although the lighting is a little weak and may have benefited from back lighting or light bounced off the wall.<br/>I love symmetry but I don''t think it''s working here. Don''t mean to slam your shot as I said it''s good these are just my opinions.</td>', 'The quality of your image is very good although the lighting is a little weak and may have benefited from back lighting or light bounced off the wall.I love symmetry but I don''t think it''s working here. Don''t mean to slam your shot as I said it''s good these are just my opinions.', '2009-05-04 21:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468686, 787593, 327, '<td valign="top">For me this is more of a portrait then a table top shot. Also I''m a bit bothered that the top of his head is cropped so tightly. Focus and tones are good.</td>', 'For me this is more of a portrait then a table top shot. Also I''m a bit bothered that the top of his head is cropped so tightly. Focus and tones are good.', '2009-05-04 21:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468691, 787911, 327, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit too soft here to really have an impact. Also I don''t get the connection with ''table top''.</td>', 'The focus is a bit too soft here to really have an impact. Also I don''t get the connection with ''table top''.', '2009-05-04 21:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468693, 787816, 327, '<td valign="top">We needed to see their faces for this to really have any impact. Other then that it was a good idea. They must be old friends to share so nicely.</td>', 'We needed to see their faces for this to really have any impact. Other then that it was a good idea. They must be old friends to share so nicely.', '2009-05-04 21:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468699, 787866, 327, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too much going on in this shot for me. Kitchen counter and doesn''t feel like a table.</td>', 'Just a bit too much going on in this shot for me. Kitchen counter and doesn''t feel like a table.', '2009-05-04 21:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468708, 787817, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. So kid like! Great, great.</td>', 'Wonderful image. So kid like! Great, great.', '2009-05-04 21:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468742, 787663, 489, '<td valign="top">I really like the layering of subjects at different depths. Great photo.</td>', 'I really like the layering of subjects at different depths. Great photo.', '2009-05-04 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468748, 787816, 101256, '<td valign="top">The overdone lighting and rather flat appearance of this image is a significant negative in what otherwise would have been an acceptable image. While the meme of the double image seems to be a major theme in this challenge, this could have been viewed as unique if time had been taken to properly expose the subjects with reduced lighting or even natural lighting.</td>', 'The overdone lighting and rather flat appearance of this image is a significant negative in what otherwise would have been an acceptable image. While the meme of the double image seems to be a major theme in this challenge, this could have been viewed as unique if time had been taken to properly expose the subjects with reduced lighting or even natural lighting.', '2009-05-04 21:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468753, 787473, 101256, '<td valign="top">A different use of bokeh and a very effective one. The pleasing tones and gentle colors are very effective and there aren''t any major parallax problems with the ice or straw in the glass. A very competant image that is pleasing to the eye. Well done.</td>', 'A different use of bokeh and a very effective one. The pleasing tones and gentle colors are very effective and there aren''t any major parallax problems with the ice or straw in the glass. A very competant image that is pleasing to the eye. Well done.', '2009-05-04 21:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468764, 787376, 101256, '<td valign="top">Common everyday objects with golden tone and balanced red color set nicely into the pleasing brown/tan table and background. Nothing is out of place and the reflections through the vinegar class are very pleasing to the eye invoking a sense of time and space. A very competant image and something more unique than a simple reflection capture. Very minimalist in concept and execution. Well done.</td>', 'Common everyday objects with golden tone and balanced red color set nicely into the pleasing brown/tan table and background. Nothing is out of place and the reflections through the vinegar class are very pleasing to the eye invoking a sense of time and space. A very competant image and something more unique than a simple reflection capture. Very minimalist in concept and execution. Well done.', '2009-05-04 21:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468779, 787790, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant still life with matching and complimentary glass reflections, perfectly centered and exposed with just on the edge white highlights in the candles.  While it appears to be just a little under exposed, the gentle candle light on the wine basket indicates that the author took the time to think out the image and properly expose it in the camera. A little nice touch that may not be immediately noticable is the glow of the candle wax - it helps illuminate the basket and properly highlight the pleasing shape of the table napkins. A wonderful set piece, the author might want to make a print using canvass as the exposure medium rather than film - this would be a very nice impressionist photograph when presented in that manner. Well done - should place high if not a ribbon.</td>', 'A very pleasant still life with matching and complimentary glass reflections, perfectly centered and exposed with just on the edge white highlights in the candles.  While it appears to be just a little under exposed, the gentle candle light on the wine basket indicates that the author took the time to think out the image and properly expose it in the camera. A little nice touch that may not be immediately noticable is the glow of the candle wax - it helps illuminate the basket and properly highlight the pleasing shape of the table napkins. A wonderful set piece, the author might want to make a print using canvass as the exposure medium rather than film - this would be a very nice impressionist photograph when presented in that manner. Well done - should place high if not a ribbon.', '2009-05-04 21:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468789, 786156, 101256, '<td valign="top">Now this is what the reviewer has been waiting for - a perfect combination of movement and still imagery, it would be simply unacceptable to do any commentary allowing the image to speak for it''self. Very inventive and clever in concept, a perfect execution of a clever idea. Well done - by rights a top ten image if not a ribbon.</td>', 'Now this is what the reviewer has been waiting for - a perfect combination of movement and still imagery, it would be simply unacceptable to do any commentary allowing the image to speak for it''self. Very inventive and clever in concept, a perfect execution of a clever idea. Well done - by rights a top ten image if not a ribbon.', '2009-05-04 21:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468803, 787777, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sometimes an image can be so subtle that it fails to convey what the author was attempting to capture. This is the case in this image - the idea doesn''t come across readily even after several viewings. Additionally, the image is a less than successful conversion being rather flat and this effect is enhanced by the extreme distance and bokeh of the subjects in the background. A little more time and thought into how the author wanted to express the idea would have helped clarify the central theme - which even to this point is lost to the reviewer.</td>', 'Sometimes an image can be so subtle that it fails to convey what the author was attempting to capture. This is the case in this image - the idea doesn''t come across readily even after several viewings. Additionally, the image is a less than successful conversion being rather flat and this effect is enhanced by the extreme distance and bokeh of the subjects in the background. A little more time and thought into how the author wanted to express the idea would have helped clarify the central theme - which even to this point is lost to the reviewer.', '2009-05-04 21:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468835, 787908, 101256, '<td valign="top">On a third viewing, this reviewer can''t quite explain why this image has such appeal, but it does. There''s nothing out of place, the effect of the tans and browns are very pleasing, the glass is properly in place and appropriately offset, the bokeh isn''t over done being just vague enough to show details - everything seems just right for some reason, yet this reviewer is uneasy rating it as high as allowed. That being said, there is nothing for it but to commit to a high score, but not quite as high as a perfect 10 - well done.</td>', 'On a third viewing, this reviewer can''t quite explain why this image has such appeal, but it does. There''s nothing out of place, the effect of the tans and browns are very pleasing, the glass is properly in place and appropriately offset, the bokeh isn''t over done being just vague enough to show details - everything seems just right for some reason, yet this reviewer is uneasy rating it as high as allowed. That being said, there is nothing for it but to commit to a high score, but not quite as high as a perfect 10 - well done.', '2009-05-04 21:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468870, 787611, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are several things right about this image and several things that are wrong. The sun lit glass and shadow are very effective from both a technical and artistic sense. On the other hand, the overly dark figures are uninteresting and do nothing to impact the image in a positive way. Use of the zone system would have helped compose and capture a more effective image along with properly metering the dark areas prior to exposure.</td>', 'There are several things right about this image and several things that are wrong. The sun lit glass and shadow are very effective from both a technical and artistic sense. On the other hand, the overly dark figures are uninteresting and do nothing to impact the image in a positive way. Use of the zone system would have helped compose and capture a more effective image along with properly metering the dark areas prior to exposure.', '2009-05-04 22:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468880, 787882, 101256, '<td valign="top">The drama inherent in the subject does not translate well when compared to the rather blank and uninteresting sky. The author''s intent here is clear and with a more effective crop at the top of the image, the artistic impact would have been significant. An experiment the author may wish to attempt would be to layer a more dramatic sky into this image and lighten some of the darker areas using the histogram as the guide and the curves control to lighten some of the darker areas.</td>', 'The drama inherent in the subject does not translate well when compared to the rather blank and uninteresting sky. The author''s intent here is clear and with a more effective crop at the top of the image, the artistic impact would have been significant. An experiment the author may wish to attempt would be to layer a more dramatic sky into this image and lighten some of the darker areas using the histogram as the guide and the curves control to lighten some of the darker areas.', '2009-05-04 22:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468893, 787887, 101256, '<td valign="top">Abstract imagery is something that this reviewer always appreciates and this image has a significant impact from that standpoint. The narrow focus field seperates the two areas of single and multi color very effectively imparting a sense of space. The use of grain and subtle tones and shades to enhance the ethereal and dream like background is very impressive. While not to the taste of the general viewership, in this reviewers opinion, this is a brilliant concieved and executed abstract image that meets the challenge subject in a unique way. Well done.</td>', 'Abstract imagery is something that this reviewer always appreciates and this image has a significant impact from that standpoint. The narrow focus field seperates the two areas of single and multi color very effectively imparting a sense of space. The use of grain and subtle tones and shades to enhance the ethereal and dream like background is very impressive. While not to the taste of the general viewership, in this reviewers opinion, this is a brilliant concieved and executed abstract image that meets the challenge subject in a unique way. Well done.', '2009-05-04 22:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468905, 787376, 327, '<td valign="top">Like it a lot, simple, good light. 7</td>', 'Like it a lot, simple, good light. 7', '2009-05-04 22:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468908, 787880, 101256, '<td valign="top">The rather odd eye is a extreme negative and the use of grayscale with object color is becoming much to common a technique to be truly effective in these challenges. Additionally, the lighting is insufficient which probaly caused the rather odd point singularity in the eye of the child and an unfortunate light bloom on the lid of the cereal box. A little more thought while composing would have helped and certainly in post processing, these faults should have been caught.</td>', 'The rather odd eye is a extreme negative and the use of grayscale with object color is becoming much to common a technique to be truly effective in these challenges. Additionally, the lighting is insufficient which probaly caused the rather odd point singularity in the eye of the child and an unfortunate light bloom on the lid of the cereal box. A little more thought while composing would have helped and certainly in post processing, these faults should have been caught.', '2009-05-04 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468914, 786120, 101256, '<td valign="top">The point singularities in the child''s eyes plus the blue cast to her naturally beautiful complexion makes this a less than expert capture and one that could use some more post processing. The central focus is a good idea and ties the whole image together properly, but the blue cast is a negative and something that could have been easily adjusted in post processing without much effort.</td>', 'The point singularities in the child''s eyes plus the blue cast to her naturally beautiful complexion makes this a less than expert capture and one that could use some more post processing. The central focus is a good idea and ties the whole image together properly, but the blue cast is a negative and something that could have been easily adjusted in post processing without much effort.', '2009-05-04 22:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468955, 787058, 101256, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that nobody in their right mind would eat a snail under any circumstances unless it was borderline starvation, this is laugh out loud funny - the snail is perfectly captured and is properly placed to be the main subject with complimentary shapes and colors in the background. Both a technical and artistic success. Well done.<br/> <br/>PS: After eating more than one of these raw in survival school in the mid-60''s, I can safely state with no small amount of authority that they aren''t my favorite raw sustinance protien - not by a long shot.</td>', 'Despite the fact that nobody in their right mind would eat a snail under any circumstances unless it was borderline starvation, this is laugh out loud funny - the snail is perfectly captured and is properly placed to be the main subject with complimentary shapes and colors in the background. Both a technical and artistic success. Well done. PS: After eating more than one of these raw in survival school in the mid-60''s, I can safely state with no small amount of authority that they aren''t my favorite raw sustinance protien - not by a long shot.', '2009-05-04 22:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468962, 787683, 105747, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468970, 787384, 105747, '<td valign="top">The flowers are in sharp focus, but the bottle appears a little fuzy. You must have removed a label. Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'The flowers are in sharp focus, but the bottle appears a little fuzy. You must have removed a label. Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468971, 787683, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is what this reviewer has been waiting for - a perfect minimalist construction that combines the minimalist meme with impressionist ideals - the abstract reflection perfectly compliments the solid and properly composed subject with the added feature of zest stripes on the skin of the orange. An excellant composition and still life complimented by pleasing tones and colors set off brilliantly with the zest scraper. An extremely effective image - well done.</td>', 'This is what this reviewer has been waiting for - a perfect minimalist construction that combines the minimalist meme with impressionist ideals - the abstract reflection perfectly compliments the solid and properly composed subject with the added feature of zest stripes on the skin of the orange. An excellant composition and still life complimented by pleasing tones and colors set off brilliantly with the zest scraper. An extremely effective image - well done.', '2009-05-04 22:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468973, 787613, 105747, '<td valign="top">Makes me thirsty, Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'Makes me thirsty, Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468976, 787663, 105747, '<td valign="top">I love the the B/W touch, it adds drama to the photo when done well. Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'I love the the B/W touch, it adds drama to the photo when done well. Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468980, 787611, 105747, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!! Very creative and inspiring. I love the B/W.Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'WOW!!!!! Very creative and inspiring. I love the B/W.Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468981, 787850, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot to me deserves a ribbon, I''m hoping it wins. Freakin amazing shot, the lighting, motif, and grittiness tell an amazing story. Great shot!</td>', 'This shot to me deserves a ribbon, I''m hoping it wins. Freakin amazing shot, the lighting, motif, and grittiness tell an amazing story. Great shot!', '2009-05-04 22:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468985, 787554, 93283, '<td valign="top">Very cool -Hot- shot indeed. I love the simplicity. Well done. 8</td>', 'Very cool -Hot- shot indeed. I love the simplicity. Well done. 8', '2009-05-04 22:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468988, 787915, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is clean, crisp, and well composed. Excellent shot! 8</td>', 'This shot is clean, crisp, and well composed. Excellent shot! 8', '2009-05-04 22:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468989, 787313, 105747, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if it is the table grain or the key that is the center of attention. I would have removed the white object,because it takes away from the photo. Great shot, good luck, Mike</td>', 'I can''t tell if it is the table grain or the key that is the center of attention. I would have removed the white object,because it takes away from the photo. Great shot, good luck, Mike', '2009-05-04 22:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468992, 787942, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another black and white with object color image, but this time it is effective in several ways. The subtle color changes in the glass along with the black and white conversion are very complimentary. Sound use of the zone system only compliments the color and the vaguely detailed background demonstrates effective use of bokeh. Well done.</td>', 'Another black and white with object color image, but this time it is effective in several ways. The subtle color changes in the glass along with the black and white conversion are very complimentary. Sound use of the zone system only compliments the color and the vaguely detailed background demonstrates effective use of bokeh. Well done.', '2009-05-04 22:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468996, 787642, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot to me is simple, well composed, and pleasant to the eye. Well done! 8</td>', 'This shot to me is simple, well composed, and pleasant to the eye. Well done! 8', '2009-05-04 22:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5468998, 786156, 93283, '<td valign="top">This shot is way cool. Very unique and one of my favorites. Congrats on an interesting shot, and I hope it ribbons. Well Done! 9</td>', 'This shot is way cool. Very unique and one of my favorites. Congrats on an interesting shot, and I hope it ribbons. Well Done! 9', '2009-05-04 22:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
