(5469207, 787927, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective, a single thought expressed in a uncommon manner. Nothing technically amiss being crisp and sharp. The author''s intent is clear and expressed effectively. Not as artistic as it could be, none the less it is a very good entry into the challenge - simple is sometimes the best approach. Well done.</td>', 'Simple and effective, a single thought expressed in a uncommon manner. Nothing technically amiss being crisp and sharp. The author''s intent is clear and expressed effectively. Not as artistic as it could be, none the less it is a very good entry into the challenge - simple is sometimes the best approach. Well done.', '2009-05-04 23:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469226, 787483, 101256, '<td valign="top">Different, but less effective that it should be. A close up view of mac and cheese is slightly off putting - never knew that up close and personal, it can look that unappetising. A little more saturation might have helped the rather unappealing color.</td>', 'Different, but less effective that it should be. A close up view of mac and cheese is slightly off putting - never knew that up close and personal, it can look that unappetising. A little more saturation might have helped the rather unappealing color.', '2009-05-04 23:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469234, 787915, 101256, '<td valign="top">There are two ways of looking at this image - one, it''s not strictly on the table. Alternatively, there is nothing in the challenge specifications that says the camera can''t be on an object that is on the table. Taking the later into account, this is a simple and very effective construction and composition. Good color and detail, there is one minor issue with the light fade on the left lower corner which isn''t immediately noticable. From an artistic standpoint, it''s conveys the sense of pleasure and texture in a nice pleasing image. Well done.</td>', 'There are two ways of looking at this image - one, it''s not strictly on the table. Alternatively, there is nothing in the challenge specifications that says the camera can''t be on an object that is on the table. Taking the later into account, this is a simple and very effective construction and composition. Good color and detail, there is one minor issue with the light fade on the left lower corner which isn''t immediately noticable. From an artistic standpoint, it''s conveys the sense of pleasure and texture in a nice pleasing image. Well done.', '2009-05-04 23:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469248, 787168, 26001, '<td valign="top">very very very impressive details and sharpness. <strike>with</strike> wish the dof was just a bit more to show more "fur". in any case, this is an excellent shot.</td>', 'very very very impressive details and sharpness. with wish the dof was just a bit more to show more "fur". in any case, this is an excellent shot.', '2009-05-04 23:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469269, 787729, 96534, '<td valign="top">This is challenging!</td>', 'This is challenging!', '2009-05-05 00:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469277, 787663, 69246, '<td valign="top">What an excellent contrast. The boy on the left is focused, dressed up, the boy on the right, much more casual and relaxed. Excellent photo.</td>', 'What an excellent contrast. The boy on the left is focused, dressed up, the boy on the right, much more casual and relaxed. Excellent photo.', '2009-05-05 00:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469305, 786585, 69246, '<td valign="top">You did a good job of minimizing the window reflections.</td>', 'You did a good job of minimizing the window reflections.', '2009-05-05 00:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469412, 787655, 99708, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Unfortunately the background is too distracting.</td>', 'Cute idea.  Unfortunately the background is too distracting.', '2009-05-05 01:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469421, 787908, 99708, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF.</td>', 'Wonderful DOF.', '2009-05-05 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469425, 786170, 99708, '<td valign="top">Adorable!</td>', 'Adorable!', '2009-05-05 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469430, 787934, 99708, '<td valign="top">That''s a game I''d like to learn.<br/>The picture is a bit out of focus - otherwise, it''s a fun one.</td>', 'That''s a game I''d like to learn.The picture is a bit out of focus - otherwise, it''s a fun one.', '2009-05-05 01:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
