(5469613, 787848, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp jack.  Great composition and dof.  The colors are also terrific.</td>', 'Nice sharp jack.  Great composition and dof.  The colors are also terrific.', '2009-05-05 04:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469616, 787455, 96751, '<td valign="top">Garlic is the most photogenic vegetable/root/edible thing...  Incredible colors, and masterful lighting.  Maybe the crop could have been shifted a tad to the left, giving it a bit more air on the left, and not quite so much negative space on the right.</td>', 'Garlic is the most photogenic vegetable/root/edible thing...  Incredible colors, and masterful lighting.  Maybe the crop could have been shifted a tad to the left, giving it a bit more air on the left, and not quite so much negative space on the right.', '2009-05-05 04:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469617, 786170, 96751, '<td valign="top">I adore cat paws.  There is something so delicate yet cartoonish about them.  I think this could have used a bit more contrast, or adjusted the lighting levels slightly.  Maybe even done in sepia.</td>', 'I adore cat paws.  There is something so delicate yet cartoonish about them.  I think this could have used a bit more contrast, or adjusted the lighting levels slightly.  Maybe even done in sepia.', '2009-05-05 04:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469619, 787927, 96751, '<td valign="top">Textbook greeting card.  Might have balanced the white a bit to reduce the grayish tone of the paper.</td>', 'Textbook greeting card.  Might have balanced the white a bit to reduce the grayish tone of the paper.', '2009-05-05 04:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469620, 787384, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and sharp colors.</td>', 'Wonderful and sharp colors.', '2009-05-05 04:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469621, 786004, 96751, '<td valign="top">Another wonderful motion capture.  Great timing, and the position of the dice is great.  Might have tried to drop them a bit more to the right to balance against the ginat printed dice.</td>', 'Another wonderful motion capture.  Great timing, and the position of the dice is great.  Might have tried to drop them a bit more to the right to balance against the ginat printed dice.', '2009-05-05 04:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469622, 787058, 96751, '<td valign="top">I adore snails.  They''re so from outer space.  Excellent detail on the eye stems.</td>', 'I adore snails.  They''re so from outer space.  Excellent detail on the eye stems.', '2009-05-05 04:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469623, 787833, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is such a gritty story here.  The cluttered table, the expression on her face, the fabulous flocked wall paper.  I''d have cropped more of the foreground, which is not very interesting andout of focus, and brought us closer to the dishing.</td>', 'There is such a gritty story here.  The cluttered table, the expression on her face, the fabulous flocked wall paper.  I''d have cropped more of the foreground, which is not very interesting andout of focus, and brought us closer to the dishing.', '2009-05-05 04:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469627, 787395, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great spin on a lovely subject.</td>', 'LOL!  Great spin on a lovely subject.', '2009-05-05 04:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469628, 787554, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures.</td>', 'Wonderful textures.', '2009-05-05 04:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469631, 787011, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is going to get some serious attention.  Excellent attention to detail.  Immaculate reflections and great sharpness.  the reflections make these every day body parts look like objects from another world.  Great work.</td>', 'This is going to get some serious attention.  Excellent attention to detail.  Immaculate reflections and great sharpness.  the reflections make these every day body parts look like objects from another world.  Great work.', '2009-05-05 04:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5469632, 787567, 96751, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many of those it took him to get in that position...Fun shot.  Lighting a little too even.  Maybe focusing more on the drink in the foreground with just spill illuminating his eyes...</td>', 'I wonder how many of those it took him to get in that position...Fun shot.  Lighting a little too even.  Maybe focusing more on the drink in the foreground with just spill illuminating his eyes...', '2009-05-05 04:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
