(5478293, 787939, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of nice detail in this. Could use a little jazzing up in PP perhaps. I tossed it into Topaz adjust just to see, and it brought out some nice detail in all that wood.</td>', 'A lot of nice detail in this. Could use a little jazzing up in PP perhaps. I tossed it into Topaz adjust just to see, and it brought out some nice detail in all that wood.', '2009-05-09 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478295, 787745, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just a fun shot, and so true.</td>', 'Just a fun shot, and so true.', '2009-05-09 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478653, 787395, 102315, '<td valign="top">Love the idea. Very different and really catches the eye both as a thumbnail and at full pixels. Also a very sharp shot with nice texture underneath eh eh.... on top of the fruit.</td>', 'Love the idea. Very different and really catches the eye both as a thumbnail and at full pixels. Also a very sharp shot with nice texture underneath eh eh.... on top of the fruit.', '2009-05-09 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478655, 787824, 102315, '<td valign="top">Seems too much like a snapshot. Also the boxes seem to have some very harsh light shining on them. Seems like it might be natural lighting though which may have been hard to control.</td>', 'Seems too much like a snapshot. Also the boxes seem to have some very harsh light shining on them. Seems like it might be natural lighting though which may have been hard to control.', '2009-05-09 21:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478656, 787955, 102315, '<td valign="top">I may have liked this shot much better if the "clutter" was a little more in focus rather than person being that your title is focused on the "clutter". Just my opinion though.</td>', 'I may have liked this shot much better if the "clutter" was a little more in focus rather than person being that your title is focused on the "clutter". Just my opinion though.', '2009-05-09 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478658, 787167, 102315, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I think the reflections are a nice subtle touch.</td>', 'Good shot. I think the reflections are a nice subtle touch.', '2009-05-09 21:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478659, 787058, 102315, '<td valign="top">I think this shot was well thought out but I don''t agree with the vegetable being in this one. They draw my eyes too much away from the main subject.</td>', 'I think this shot was well thought out but I don''t agree with the vegetable being in this one. They draw my eyes too much away from the main subject.', '2009-05-09 21:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478661, 787593, 102315, '<td valign="top">This seems like an odd shot for the challenge. I will however assume that the camera was sitting on a table top to shoot it but I have a feeling it won''t do well because of that.</td>', 'This seems like an odd shot for the challenge. I will however assume that the camera was sitting on a table top to shoot it but I have a feeling it won''t do well because of that.', '2009-05-09 21:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478662, 787861, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great use of the challenge details. Tells a story in just one shot.</td>', 'Great use of the challenge details. Tells a story in just one shot.', '2009-05-09 21:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478663, 787794, 102315, '<td valign="top">This seems more shot down "onto" a table top instead of being shot "from" it.</td>', 'This seems more shot down "onto" a table top instead of being shot "from" it.', '2009-05-09 21:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478664, 787862, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very relaxing shot. Makes me think of summer.</td>', 'Very relaxing shot. Makes me think of summer.', '2009-05-09 21:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478665, 787850, 102315, '<td valign="top">Like the dark grainy look.</td>', 'Like the dark grainy look.', '2009-05-09 21:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478666, 786585, 102315, '<td valign="top">One of my top rated photo''s. Only one technical deficiency''s would be the color''s reflecting off of what look''s like a window and the knife and spoon being just a tad OOF.</td>', 'One of my top rated photo''s. Only one technical deficiency''s would be the color''s reflecting off of what look''s like a window and the knife and spoon being just a tad OOF.', '2009-05-09 21:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478669, 787840, 102315, '<td valign="top">A tad over processed and the reflection does not add to the photo. It actually distracts from it. Makes me look everywhere trying to figure out what''s going on it.</td>', 'A tad over processed and the reflection does not add to the photo. It actually distracts from it. Makes me look everywhere trying to figure out what''s going on it.', '2009-05-09 22:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478670, 787657, 102315, '<td valign="top">Very classy shot. I like it.</td>', 'Very classy shot. I like it.', '2009-05-09 22:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478755, 785704, 79720, '<td valign="top">Very nice duotone processing. The cropping seems a bit odd, the model''s left knee seems to be disassociated with the form.</td>', 'Very nice duotone processing. The cropping seems a bit odd, the model''s left knee seems to be disassociated with the form.', '2009-05-10 00:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478759, 787809, 79720, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour choices...the specular highlight on the glass is a bit bold. Windows or strip lights? Hard to say.</td>', 'Interesting colour choices...the specular highlight on the glass is a bit bold. Windows or strip lights? Hard to say.', '2009-05-10 00:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478760, 787376, 79720, '<td valign="top">I like the refraction/colour shift in the bottle of vinegar, overall there seems to be a significant orange/yellow tinge to the white balance. By design, perhaps?</td>', 'I like the refraction/colour shift in the bottle of vinegar, overall there seems to be a significant orange/yellow tinge to the white balance. By design, perhaps?', '2009-05-10 00:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478763, 787953, 79720, '<td valign="top">Ah, the good ol'' still life. The green wall has given the poor daisies a tint that makes me wish you''d separated from the background a bit more.</td>', 'Ah, the good ol'' still life. The green wall has given the poor daisies a tint that makes me wish you''d separated from the background a bit more.', '2009-05-10 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478764, 787155, 79720, '<td valign="top">A voyeur''s-eye view? This might have been a bit more effective in B&amp;W.</td>', 'A voyeur''s-eye view? This might have been a bit more effective in B&W.', '2009-05-10 00:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478766, 787846, 79720, '<td valign="top">Very nicely conceptualized and executed. Wish I had the patience to set up like this!</td>', 'Very nicely conceptualized and executed. Wish I had the patience to set up like this!', '2009-05-10 00:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478771, 787582, 79720, '<td valign="top">Trying to improve on Langdon''s shot, are we? At least your choice of billiards is correct...forget the 8-ball stuff. :-P</td>', 'Trying to improve on Langdon''s shot, are we? At least your choice of billiards is correct...forget the 8-ball stuff. :-P', '2009-05-10 00:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478775, 787866, 79720, '<td valign="top">That on-board flash is a harsh mistress.<br/> <br/>Check out the <a href="//strobist.blogspot.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Strobist blog</a>, in particular <a href="//www.youtube.com/watch?v=lKAD7leNOVY" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this video intro</a>, which does a wonderful job of showing how still-lifes (lives?) benefit from getting that flash off-camera.</td>', 'That on-board flash is a harsh mistress. Check out the Strobist blog, in particular this video intro, which does a wonderful job of showing how still-lifes (lives?) benefit from getting that flash off-camera.', '2009-05-10 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478778, 787841, 79720, '<td valign="top">Clever. The snooted lighting is superb.</td>', 'Clever. The snooted lighting is superb.', '2009-05-10 00:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478780, 787642, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nice stock image. Pretty much nailed the focus/lighting.</td>', 'Nice stock image. Pretty much nailed the focus/lighting.', '2009-05-10 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478781, 787690, 79720, '<td valign="top">...slightly <i>undercooked</i> beef, at that. :-)</td>', '...slightly undercooked beef, at that. :-)', '2009-05-10 00:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478783, 787833, 79720, '<td valign="top">I like the effect. Pinhole? It leaves me wishing there was some more context to the scene.</td>', 'I like the effect. Pinhole? It leaves me wishing there was some more context to the scene.', '2009-05-10 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478785, 787554, 79720, '<td valign="top">Nice, simplistic and minimal. It holds my attention by the negative space.</td>', 'Nice, simplistic and minimal. It holds my attention by the negative space.', '2009-05-10 00:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478786, 787810, 79720, '<td valign="top">Very nicely lit portrait. Can almost sense the despair, too bad you''re known as such a jolly character!</td>', 'Very nicely lit portrait. Can almost sense the despair, too bad you''re known as such a jolly character!', '2009-05-10 00:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5478787, 787817, 79720, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting and the dutone/high key. A slight change in angle/perspective might have shown him looking at Ducky, instead of looking asleep.</td>', 'Love the lighting and the dutone/high key. A slight change in angle/perspective might have shown him looking at Ducky, instead of looking asleep.', '2009-05-10 00:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
