(5479685, 787663, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great capture of just the right moment. The moving woman and still boy both looking into the camera. the boys in the next booth with their faces visible, and of course that studious boy on the left. But most of all, it fits the spirit of the challenge: a new perspective by using the table top, where crayons and salt shakers and napkins have exaggerated importance, and little boys must compete with them for your attention, which they do admirably. Posthumous Red Ribbon.<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Great capture of just the right moment. The moving woman and still boy both looking into the camera. the boys in the next booth with their faces visible, and of course that studious boy on the left. But most of all, it fits the spirit of the challenge: a new perspective by using the table top, where crayons and salt shakers and napkins have exaggerated importance, and little boys must compete with them for your attention, which they do admirably. Posthumous Red Ribbon. ', '2009-05-10 23:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
