(5480183, 787395, 47487, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand why this didn''t score higher. I didn''t vote this challenge but it''d have had an 8 or 9 from me easy. Technically excellent (look at the texture on that orange and the careful control of the lighting!), aesthetically pleasing, creative even to the letter of the challenge description: you placed your camera on the table (upside-down) and definitely got a different perspective on some everyday objects! I love this. Great job. A 5.38 is nothing to be sad about, but I''m amazed that this isn''t on the front page.</td>', 'I really don''t understand why this didn''t score higher. I didn''t vote this challenge but it''d have had an 8 or 9 from me easy. Technically excellent (look at the texture on that orange and the careful control of the lighting!), aesthetically pleasing, creative even to the letter of the challenge description: you placed your camera on the table (upside-down) and definitely got a different perspective on some everyday objects! I love this. Great job. A 5.38 is nothing to be sad about, but I''m amazed that this isn''t on the front page.', '2009-05-11 04:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
