(5480240, 787593, 101118, '<td valign="top">wow, didn''t expect to get this low.  the only crop was to take out the right side of photo.  I thought this would be a community of integrity and people would trust that the camera was on a flat surface hence the top of the head missing, "not a normal view".  I guess I broke too many "photography rules", so to speak, ...still learning some of those.  I do appreciate the comments, they will help.   ...next time.</td>', 'wow, didn''t expect to get this low.  the only crop was to take out the right side of photo.  I thought this would be a community of integrity and people would trust that the camera was on a flat surface hence the top of the head missing, "not a normal view".  I guess I broke too many "photography rules", so to speak, ...still learning some of those.  I do appreciate the comments, they will help.   ...next time.', '2009-05-11 05:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
