(5480315, 787593, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent example of dpchallenge voter blindness. I think this is a very, very nice shot that got hammered big time because people expected to see a table or part of one in the shot. The challenge was to shoot from a table top to get a different perspective, which you''ve done perfectly - this is not a usual angle for a portrait. I like the lighting, the pose, the expression. The shot loses absolutely nothing with the crop. Trust your gut - not dpchallenge voters. I could easily see this shot as part of an exhibition or in a gallery.</td>', 'This is an excellent example of dpchallenge voter blindness. I think this is a very, very nice shot that got hammered big time because people expected to see a table or part of one in the shot. The challenge was to shoot from a table top to get a different perspective, which you''ve done perfectly - this is not a usual angle for a portrait. I like the lighting, the pose, the expression. The shot loses absolutely nothing with the crop. Trust your gut - not dpchallenge voters. I could easily see this shot as part of an exhibition or in a gallery.', '2009-05-11 08:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5480321, 787663, 86447, '<td valign="top">A Blue!  A BLUE!!   I''m so happy this got a ribbon for you!   An amazingly good job, Michelle!</td>', 'A Blue!  A BLUE!!   I''m so happy this got a ribbon for you!   An amazingly good job, Michelle!', '2009-05-11 08:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
