(5480495, 787663, 2553, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  This is just a wonderful candid, and a superb black and white. I love the tonal range and the depth of "personality" it has.  Love your PP as well.  Cool, cool, cool image!</td>', 'Congratulations!  This is just a wonderful candid, and a superb black and white. I love the tonal range and the depth of "personality" it has.  Love your PP as well.  Cool, cool, cool image!', '2009-05-11 11:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
