(5513294, 787455, 107428, '<td valign="top">Hey Jo, <br/>You should be happy - this is a great image! I really like the lo-key style and the shine in the skins. And yes, the roots are good.<br/>Try experimenting with white balance, the colour tone is a little on the warm side for my taste.<br/>How does this garlic look with a fully symetrical reflection? <br/>Your images are reflecting your photographic growth. You are getting better for sure!</td>', 'Hey Jo, You should be happy - this is a great image! I really like the lo-key style and the shine in the skins. And yes, the roots are good.Try experimenting with white balance, the colour tone is a little on the warm side for my taste.How does this garlic look with a fully symetrical reflection? Your images are reflecting your photographic growth. You are getting better for sure!', '2009-06-03 23:55:44.000000', NULL, 0),
