(5584642, 787908, 87808, '<td valign="top">well you have a whole bunch of normal crap behind your glass.  Even though it is meant to be a tble shot, you can do a set up shot so it looks natural adn not just a glass of beer plunked down on a table. you have a strip light (?) going doing the glass which is distracting, the white foam is good, could have used a small light behind the beer to make it appear the gorgeous amber colour that it is, get rid of trash can, who puts a trash can in a photo for a challenge.  also i seem to spot a dart board, if it is one, open it up, great image iwth that in it and crop out those white things which i presumes are pictures of some sort.<br/> <br/>redo it  but do it better next time, actually put some thought into it</td>', 'well you have a whole bunch of normal crap behind your glass.  Even though it is meant to be a tble shot, you can do a set up shot so it looks natural adn not just a glass of beer plunked down on a table. you have a strip light (?) going doing the glass which is distracting, the white foam is good, could have used a small light behind the beer to make it appear the gorgeous amber colour that it is, get rid of trash can, who puts a trash can in a photo for a challenge.  also i seem to spot a dart board, if it is one, open it up, great image iwth that in it and crop out those white things which i presumes are pictures of some sort. redo it  but do it better next time, actually put some thought into it', '2009-07-23 19:34:57.000000', NULL, 0),
